{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_function", "label": "g(l) = l + delta(n,l) \u2014 the defect ladder", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "F_core's tail is exactly Coulombic with net charge 1 (q_eff = -rV = 1.000000 over 20-298 a0), so every bound candidate admits an EXACT defect representation D = -1/(2 nu^2) with nu = sigma - g(l). Since energy order IS nu order, Madelung becomes two statements about one scalar function of l.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_within", "label": "(G-within) g increasing in l inside each sigma-class", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_across", "label": "(G-across) max g at sigma+1 minus min g at sigma < 1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_gtest83", "label": "pack83/gtest83.py", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_doubt_sited_control", "label": "The doubt-sited control (R82.2) and the g-channel floor", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The l=4 banked D values equal the hydrogenic -1/(2n^2) to five decimals, so they are expected to be a FLOOR, not a measurement: the instrument cannot measure delta where delta is not being computed. Under R82.2 clause 5 that RESTRICTS the claim to l <= 3 rather than voiding it.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_routes_abc", "label": "Routes (a), (b) and (c) to the ordering property", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "(c) evaluates the property at the relaxed field directly at every Z, so (a) \u2014 the statement proved Z by Z \u2014 is a PRESENTATION of (c), not an alternative to it. (b) carries a property with a bound attached.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_equivalence_not_bound", "label": "This derives the equivalence, not the bound", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Converting Madelung into a condition on g does not show that F_core must satisfy that condition. No property of F_core is derived, so any claim that clause 1 is closed by this file is false.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_function", "target": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_within", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_function", "target": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_across", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S83-ITEM1-GLADDER.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s83_item1_gladder_g_function", "target": "recovered_prediction_s79_item1_fixedfield_madelung_ordering", "relation": "references", "confid